[[Skyrim:Volsung (item)|Volsung]] is a [[Skyrim:Corundum|corundum]] [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest Mask|mask]] obtained by killing the eponymous [[Skyrim:Volsung (creature)|Volsung]] at the end of the [[Skyrim:Nordic Ruins|Nordic ruin]], [[Skyrim:Volskygge|Volskygge]]. The artifact's enchantment allows you to breathe underwater, carry an additional twenty units of weight, and increases your [[Skyrim:Fortify Barter|bartering]] abilities by twenty points. It can be [[Skyrim:Tempering|tempered]] with [[Skyrim:Corundum Ingot|corundum ingots]].<includeonly>

For more information, see the [[Skyrim:Volsung (item)|Volsung]] article.</includeonly><noinclude>
